  // walked a cell at a time through the grid, and only the steps in a node that holds liquid are counted. (The whole
  // span was taken at first, which is right for a pool and wrong for anything with air in it: a thin stream with
  // water somewhere behind it was drawn as deep as the gap between them, and nearly black.) A film or a spray too
  // thin to fill a node is taken as a ball's width.
